Attribute braces on a list-item marker line

```
-{.item} An attributed item.
- {.c} literal text

- {a=b .c}
  # Attributed heading
.
<ul>
  <li class="item"><p>An attributed item.</p></li>
  <li><p>{.c} literal text</p></li>
  <li>
    <h1 a="b" class="c" id="Attributed-heading">Attributed heading</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
```
